                                                "sense_id": "d6dc9128-7cb7-373e-bce3-f367932380c3",
                                                "text": "This all relates to what happened in the 1990s, in the bloody aftermath of Yugoslavia splintering into separate nations."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "111e29ac-2d2c-37c1-be3f-0633bef35417",
